WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:01.900
We'll be right back.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:31.310
Oh, yeah.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.030
Dr. Tenma, you're here, aren't you?

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:21.240
Yes, I am.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.700
My name is Skunk.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:24.740
So?

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:29.160
Doctor, you have the right to be the world's best robot engineer.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.780
But I failed again today.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.740
I failed to make a robot with a completely human-like mind.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.620
I'm not a complete failure.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.260
Crab.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.420
Then what do I have to do?

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:53.310
This is a circuit called the omega factor.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:56.420
If this is incorporated into the robot's electronic brain,

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.090
its mind will be human-like.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.600
As you wish, just like a human being.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.480
I don't want to use such junk!

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.380
I'm sorry to say this, but please take it back!

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.560
Are you sure, professor?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.600
You'll be sorry if you don't use it.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.260
You don't know his power.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:16.900
That's enough!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.290
Go back now!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:28.750
That old man is a big idiot!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.560
Father, you're a bad scientist.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:45.670
How can a human-level robot be able to make something like this?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.180
Father, I have a question.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.620
What if we made a child robot?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.440
A child robot?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.040
A child robot?

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.340
I see.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.320
Why didn't you notice that?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.700
Robot-go-go!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.130
I'll re-design it into a child's robot!

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.230
A child's robot, you say?

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.340
What are you going to do with such a thing?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.160
But this is a children's show.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.460
Don't say anything!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.190
It's the Commander-in-Chief's order!

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:17.150
Get on with it right away!

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.850
Huh? What is it, Tobio?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:23.200
You promised to take me to the amusement park today, didn't you?

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.300
Huh? What? Oh, I see.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.750
Eh? I'm waiting!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.760
Dad is busy today.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:30.590
See you next time.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:30.910
No?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.190
I won't.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.100
I'll be there next week.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.530
I don't want to!

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:38.390
Go to hell!

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:00.720
Welcome back, Jump.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.980
Welcome back, Taro!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:03.400
What?

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.650
Tobio went out on his own in a robot car?

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.680
How can a child drive a robot car?

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.320
That's a lie!

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.500
Please save me, Tobio.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:57.420
Tobio!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.020
Please...

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:00.510
What is it?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:07.910
It's about the robot.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.570
Can you name it Tobio instead of me?

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:17.070
I want it to be cool and the strongest robot in the world.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.650
Let's do that.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.720
So cheer up.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:23.700
I'm sure.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.150
Will you promise me?

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:26.370
I promise.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:29.970
Because my...

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.910
Tobio! My only Tobio!

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.790
Chief, I have a bad feeling.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.690
If such a robot is completed, it is the same as the devil was born.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.320
I think it's better to stop it.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:17.230
Fly in the sky with 100,000 horsepower, prepare a laser gun and a machine gun,

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:19.200
Isn't it like a new weapon?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.100
Honda-kun, I will decide whether it is a devil or an angel.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.820
Is it a weapon?

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.130
He is my son.

00:07:30.924 --> 00:07:31.984
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:07:32.076 --> 00:07:33.456
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

00:07:33.516 --> 00:07:35.036
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.300
How's the defense, Skunk?

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.140
Hehehe, just like this.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:51.200
Look, now I can reveal Tenma's secret.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:58.280
I'll attach the Omega factor I invented to this butterfly robot he designed.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:58.980
Then...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.080
That's why I can make the best android in the world.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.180
This time, I will make it.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.410
My dream.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.380
It's just like a human.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:09.720
It's a perfect robot.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:19.100
Stop this research, Tenma.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.600
Of course, I understand your thoughts.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.010
But this robot is dangerous.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:25.300
But, Master.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.600
This will only be harmful to humans.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.230
Listen, Tenma, get rid of this robot by tomorrow night.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:35.030
Master!

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:40.310
What did you say?

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:30.500
Thank you.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.490
I'm begging you. It's your father. Please call him.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:53.780
Come on, go with your father.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.110
You are my child!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:04.780
As I thought, it was completed.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.810
If this is known, it will be a big deal.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.320
I will take this child home.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.040
I will raise him as a son.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.650
If you complain, do whatever you want.

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:29.800
I will learn more and more.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.320
I'm going to eat.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:35.300
Say sorry.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:42.390
I'm going to eat.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.780
Eat a lot.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:47.400
I'm not going to eat.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:02.170
I can fly!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.290
Jump! Come here!

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:32.910
It's Tobio!

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:46.630
Tobio, what's wrong?

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.090
Tobio!

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:49.150
Stop it!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:57.280
What's wrong?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.550
It's getting worse and worse!

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.690
That's right! I suddenly lost consciousness and can't respond!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.800
What if I take you to the Science Department and investigate?

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:15.130
How can you do that? It's a secret that she's in my house!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.080
I can only ask you and Kishi Ushiyama!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.190
I understand. I'll be right there.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.370
Damn it!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:22.970
Huh?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:29.030
I just got a call from Dr. Tenma...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.300
It seems that the robot is broken.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:37.200
Think about Manichi and bring the robot processor.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:52.260
Doctor, if that child explodes in the city, it will be a big deal.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.750
At this time, I think it is best to disassemble and process.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.150
Please stop disassembling.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.160
Honda-kun, you're a woman, aren't you?

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.240
Even though you're a woman, don't you think she's cute?

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.180
She's cute just by looking at her.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.350
Inside, she's a robot.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.300
A monster with 100,000 horsepower.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:59.980
Thank you.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.080
Someone is calling me.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:05.640
Someone is calling me from a far away place.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.680
Who is it?

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.500
Maybe it's another me.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:20.300
Yo! The prince is born!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.590
You are the world's best robot with omega-carbons!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.890
You will be able to become a ruler that even humans can obey!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:41.060
That's right! I will name you Atlas!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.570
Atlas, the first ruler!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:49.690
Vivian, you will take care of Atlas.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.280
Yes, Master.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.710
However, this man will teach you. Don't forget.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:16:59.190
Take him with you.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.450
Atlas, come here!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:11.360
Hurry! Turn off the power!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:30.360
Why am I here?

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:17.690
A fire broke out in the building.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:31.630
What is that?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:44.380
A robot is flying through the air and rescuing a human from inside the building.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:48.300
The robot is flying as it is.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.180
It seems that it is chasing after an abandoned car.

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.470
Tobio, if you cause such an accident,

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:09.330
you will be exposed to the fact that I ignored your orders and created you.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:13.620
If that happens, I can't let my father be in the Department of Science.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.200
Tobio, let's go to America with your father.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:22.360
If you go to America, you will be able to live freely.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:26.720
I'm going to ask for a vacation.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:34.070
Jump, come here, come here!

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:45.020
How is it?

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:46.230
He's my son.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:59.240
Rian!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.890
Am I the name of a demon?

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:08.320
No, your name is Atlas.

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:10.330
That's strange.

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:11.420
Father said so.

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:13.050
What is a demon?

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.940
I'm going to go to America on a ship with my father.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:38.420
Ah! It's a iceberg!

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:40.740
It attacked our ship.

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:42.830
Everyone is in danger!

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:45.140
When I was desperately fighting the iceberg,

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:46.940
you appeared in front of me.

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:48.950
You are...

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:51.120
Next time, Tetsuan Atom.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:52.360
Atom vs. Atlas.

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:53.560
Look forward to it!

00:23:30.124 --> 00:23:32.124
Oh
